{"title":"1982 AHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/9/d39f112cebd6eb4879bd8cb2b1b82d28b73a7fc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;1, b&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/4/864faa68b0e6e41c379da1a1873eac3e4d8306f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=\\frac{\\log_b(\\log_ba)}{\\log_ba}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"124\" height=\"43\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62fc51ae72c68e36e98b0b1a75de792aabe10754.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^p$\" width=\"16\" height=\"12\" /> equals \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/5/b9510c39b99200599a28a38e3e77056f6a2b6baf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf {(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad  \\textbf {(B)}\\ b \\qquad  \\textbf {(C)}\\ \\log_ab \\qquad  \\textbf {(D)}\\ \\log_ba \\qquad  \\textbf {(E)}\\ a^{\\log_ba}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"457\" height=\"22\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>p (log <sub> b</sub> a) = log <sub>b </sub> (log <sub> b</sub> a)\n</p><p>log <sub> b</sub> (a<sup> p</sup>) =log <sub> b </sub> (log<sub>b</sub> a)\n</p><p>a<sup>p</sup> = log <sub> b</sub> a\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/24581e7c5397ed4be31561f0b33c88a5fa2349ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log_b(\\log_ba)}{\\log_ba}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"93\" height=\"45\" /> strongly resembles the change of base rule. Recall that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/3/d63d83a4cbf2d5a083ef0395bdc74452e3ad93d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_ba=\\frac{\\log_ca}{\\log_cb}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"116\" height=\"44\" />. Taking the base on the RHS to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/a/d3a408e83cd5ec3119c5bb478a67a19615ecd00b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p = \\log_a(\\log_ba)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />. Raising <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> to both sides, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36c166c6678facc78a5e78037919032ce5eaa7c9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^p = a^{\\log_a(\\log_ba)}\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/0/d902082d18efea9acdcbaf6855b16eedbc4265be.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)} ~ \\log_ba}\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p>~ cxsmi\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME\" title=\"1982 AHSME\">1982 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1982 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1982_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1982 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1982\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php